> explain (costs off)
> select b.unique1 from la_b b
> where b.unique1 < 20 and b.hundred in (select min(c.hundred) from la_b c where c.odd = b.odd)
QUERY PLAN:text
Nested Loop
  ->  Seq Scan on la_b b
        Filter: (unique1 < 20)
  ->  Subquery Scan on "ANY_subquery"
        Filter: (b.hundred = "ANY_subquery".min)
        ->  Result
              InitPlan 1
                ->  Limit
                      ->  Index Scan using la_b_hundred on la_b c
                            Index Cond: (hundred IS NOT NULL)
                            Filter: (odd = b.odd)
-- EXPLAIN

